                "text": "Great to meet with outstanding leaders in the Army Medical Department Medical Service Corps in my D.C. office this week. Thank you for your work in improving healthcare and medical services for our veterans, servicemembers, and military families. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 https://t.co/ats6D2xTSP",
