                "text": "I served our country for 20 years in the U.S. Navy. As veterans, we step up to the plate for each other\u2014it\u2019s engrained in who we are. \n\nI helped secure funding for a new VA facility that will serve over 54,000 veterans in El Paso & West Texas. \u2b07\ufe0f\n\nhttps://t.co/gjgG1K4jCq",
